{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>\ud83c\udff0 One world. One winner. Then it all begins again.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Conquest! is a persistent multiplayer strategy game where players battle in a live, shared world \u2014 until one emerges victorious. Born on IRC in 1993, rebuilt for modern platforms, it\u2019s fast, brutal, and unforgiving.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\ud83d\udd52 <strong>Instant command resolution</strong> \u2014 no waiting, no fluff<br>\ud83c\udf0d <strong>Persistent world</strong> \u2014 all players affect a single, shared game<br>\u2694\ufe0f <strong>Wage war across 3 distinct regions</strong> in every Age <br>\ud83d\udc51 <strong>The world resets only when a player wins</strong> \u2014 can you survive to the end?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">There\u2019s no base-building. No animations. No filler. Just raw strategy and a world that never resets... until someone conquers it all.<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1771260/extras/Promotion.png?t=1751669786\" /></div> </p>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"Admiral","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/1771260/42cc56ad0a9902e30fb2594c2399335c0b83dad0.jpg"},{"name":"Adventurer","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/1771260/3def5d35b563b65539da835b5f217371f73989a5.jpg"},{"name":"Agent","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/1771260/041b10f5beac76d426d7d069bab927b61942280c.jpg"},{"name":"Amateur","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/1771260/838bf994c4e8bbd9cb52e92afc8075a87e3bbfcf.jpg"},{"name":"Baby Boomer","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/1771260/6f082ccdc6215bd7e275f4388f2f92e414ebe511.jpg"},{"name":"Collector","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity